WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.037
Section 7.

00:00:01.987 --> 00:00:04.425
What Free Press Looks Like.

00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:09.625
Across Canada, a new generation of independent outlets has emerged.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:16.725
They prove that Canadians will pay for journalism, they just won't pay for managed press releases dressed up as news.
